    "detailed_description": "<strong>Starlab</strong> is a 2D space sim featuring a seamless solar system, Newtonian physics, a customizable player character, base building and automation, power grid management, a fleet of vehicles, and an arsenal of weapons to research and discover.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.poster.avif?t=1744159337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.webm?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.mp4?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ARRIVING AT EARTH</h2>An unprecedented <strong>anomaly</strong> has shattered the galaxy\u2019s peace, driving you to the quarantined ruins of humanity\u2019s first star.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AUTOMATE YOUR STARLAB</h2>Progress from chopping trees and <strong>mining</strong> ore to <strong>constructing</strong> power plants and <strong>automating</strong> electric mines. Load vehicles to <strong>transport</strong> resources seamlessly between worlds, optimizing your interplanetary operations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROCKET ACROSS THE SOLAR SYSTEM</h2>Suit up and ensure you have enough oxygen as you <strong>rocket</strong> yourself to the Moon and beyond, exploring new frontiers and expanding your reach.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.poster.avif?t=1744159337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.webm?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.mp4?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Stylize</strong> your character with custom hair, color, and clothing options<br></li><li> <strong>Pilot</strong> rockets, jetpacks, trucks, and more with Newtonian physics for realistic space travel<br></li><li> <strong>Wield</strong> an arsenal of weapons against alien swarms and hostile bots<br></li><li> <strong>Automate</strong> mining, processing, and manufacturing resources to streamline your operations<br></li><li> <strong>Farm</strong> crops by planting seeds, watering them, and ensuring they have plenty of light for sustainable food production<br></li><li> <strong>Build</strong> structures from pylons and girders to create robust bases<br></li><li> <strong>Manage</strong> electrical grids with solar panels, power plants, batteries, and power lines to keep your base running efficiently<br></li><li> <strong>Research</strong> next-gen technology from space suits to jet packs, to enhance your capabilities and survival</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Starlab</strong> is a 2D space sim featuring a seamless solar system, Newtonian physics, a customizable player character, base building and automation, power grid management, a fleet of vehicles, and an arsenal of weapons to research and discover.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.poster.avif?t=1744159337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.webm?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.mp4?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ARRIVING AT EARTH</h2>An unprecedented <strong>anomaly</strong> has shattered the galaxy\u2019s peace, driving you to the quarantined ruins of humanity\u2019s first star.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AUTOMATE YOUR STARLAB</h2>Progress from chopping trees and <strong>mining</strong> ore to <strong>constructing</strong> power plants and <strong>automating</strong> electric mines. Load vehicles to <strong>transport</strong> resources seamlessly between worlds, optimizing your interplanetary operations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROCKET ACROSS THE SOLAR SYSTEM</h2>Suit up and ensure you have enough oxygen as you <strong>rocket</strong> yourself to the Moon and beyond, exploring new frontiers and expanding your reach.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.poster.avif?t=1744159337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.webm?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.mp4?t=1744159337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Stylize</strong> your character with custom hair, color, and clothing options<br></li><li> <strong>Pilot</strong> rockets, jetpacks, trucks, and more with Newtonian physics for realistic space travel<br></li><li> <strong>Wield</strong> an arsenal of weapons against alien swarms and hostile bots<br></li><li> <strong>Automate</strong> mining, processing, and manufacturing resources to streamline your operations<br></li><li> <strong>Farm</strong> crops by planting seeds, watering them, and ensuring they have plenty of light for sustainable food production<br></li><li> <strong>Build</strong> structures from pylons and girders to create robust bases<br></li><li> <strong>Manage</strong> electrical grids with solar panels, power plants, batteries, and power lines to keep your base running efficiently<br></li><li> <strong>Research</strong> next-gen technology from space suits to jet packs, to enhance your capabilities and survival</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Commandeer a fleet of advanced spacecraft, arm yourself with futuristic weaponry, and launch into space! From Earth to the far reaches of the solar system\u2014build cutting-edge research labs, fend off alien bugs, and dismantle rogue machines.",
